:''Not to be confused with [[Satan Claus]].''
'''Dark Emperor Santa''' (悪魔王サンタ ''Akuma Ō Santa'', '''Devil King Santa''') is a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]]/[[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] variant of [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.9 Update|Version 2.0.9]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

