==Enemy==
He is the Christmas spin-off of [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]], made to look like Santa on his sleigh. His sleigh-throne is pulled by dark minions with reindeer antlers and red noses. Rather than a glass of coffee jelly, Dark Emperor Santa holds a turkey leg instead.

This enemy has the same range and attack animation as Dark Emperor Nyandam, but moves a bit faster and has a much faster attack rate, along with a 100% chance to freeze your units for 4 seconds. Trait-wise, he only gains the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait, not [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]].

==Strategy==
Due to his low health, Dark Emperor Santa can be easily dispatched with strong [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] like [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. [[Maiden Cat (Rare Cat)|Wrestling Cat]] is a direct counter due to being strong against Red and immune to freeze. [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]] can fight fire with fire and freeze him if well timed. While [[:Category:Anti-Aku Cats|anti-Aku Cats]] are far rarer, they also work well due to his [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait giving him an additional weakness. Rushers like [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]] can be used to rush in after an attack and help kill him.

