==Trivia==
*Dark Emperor Santa is a regular enemy in [[The Battle Cats POP!]]. His description is: "Created devious magics to break Cats' holiday spirit. Uses cheap materials to keep his Xmas profit margin low."
*Dark Emperor Santa's [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] trait was given to him in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]], before which he was only a [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemy. This change was likely made because his Japanese name (悪魔王サンタ ''Akuma Ō Santa'', "Devil King Santa") contains the word 悪魔 ''Akuma'' ("Devil"), which is also the Japanese name of the Aku trait.
**Dark Emperor Santa is the only Aku to have gained the Aku trait retroactively instead of being Aku from the start, the first Aku to have another trait, and the first Aku who is not predominantly blue. The second is [[Poultrio]].
**In The Battle Cats POP! and [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], Dark Emperor Santa is still purely a Red enemy and lacks the Aku trait, as there are no Aku in these ports.

